# AI Usage Policy

We allow the use of AI in the xLaDe project. 

---

## Disclosure

It is not mandatory to disclose the usage.
However, we generally encourage to disclose and explain the usage of AI models.

---

## Accountability and Responsibility

The person using AI model bears full accountability and responsibility for that particular contribution or change.
The person should know and understand what the changes do.
In case of any problem with AI generated output, the person would be completely liable.

---

## Banned practices

- Using AI blindly
- Submitting AI-generated code without understanding
- Translating xLaDe into rust with AI models

---
